3. EXECUTION WORKFLOW MATLAB CODE VILLAVICENCIO\
================================================================================\
\
3.1 Complete Pipeline Execution\
-------------------------------\
Execute the following scripts in order (from Matlab_Code_Villavicencio folder):\
\
STEP 1: Data Processing\
------------------------\
>> Dataset_Villavicencio\
\
Input File: RawData_Villavicencio.xlsx\
\
This creates:\
  \'95 Results_Dataset_Villavicencio.mat\
  \'95 imputation_statistics_villavicencio.mat\
  \'95 imputation_report_villavicencio.txt\
  \'95 Two figures showing epidemic dynamics\
\
STEP 2: SEIR Control Model Estimation\
-------------------------------------\
>> Control_SEIR_Villavicencio\
\
Input File: Results_Dataset_Villavicencio.mat\
\
This creates:\
  \'95 Results_Control_SEIR_Villavicencio.mat\
  \'95 Control_SEIR_Villavicencio.png\
\
STEP 3: Control Efficacy Analysis\
---------------------------------\
>> Analysis_Efficacy_Control_Villavicencio\
\
Input File: Results_Control_SEIR_Villavicencio.mat\
\
This creates:\
  \'95 Results_Efficacy_Control_Villavicencio.mat\
  \'95 Efficacy_Analysis_Control_Villavicencio.png\
  \'95 Weight_Sensitivity.png\
\
STEP 4: Hybrid Model Training\
-----------------------------\
>> ML_Hybrid_SEIR_Villavicencio\
\
Input Files: Results_Efficacy_Control_Villavicencio.mat\
\
This creates:\
  \'95 Results_Hybrid_Villavicencio.mat\
  \'95 Hybrid_Models_Comparison_Villavicencio.png\
  \'95 Hybrid_Error_Analysis_Villavicencio.png\
\
STEP 5: Hybrid Model Gain Analysis\
----------------------------------\
>> Analysis_Gain_Hybrid_Villavicencio\
\
Input File: \
  \'95 Results_Hybrid_Villavicencio.mat\
  \'95 Results_Control_SEIR_Villavicencio.mat\
\
This creates:\
  \'95 Results_Gain_Hybrid_Villavicencio.mat\
  \'95 Hybrid_Gain_Analysis_Villavicencio.png\
\
